"'Twitter Card' to the correct account. See https://developer.twitter.com/en/"
"docs/tweets/optimize-with-cards/overview/summary"
msgstr ""
"Lo nom d’utilizaire Twitter de l’organizacion, comença pel simbòl « @ ». "
"Ex. : @RAP_Asso. Es necessari per atribuir la Twitter Card (cartelon) al bon "
"compte.Veire https://developer.twitter.com/en/docs/tweets/optimize-with-"
"cards/overview/summary"

#: src/apps/petitions/admin.py:120 src/apps/presets/admin.py:113
